{"type":"message","id":"5c998833","parentId":"177390f1","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:45:24.464Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API calls worked with X-API-Key header. Let me analyze what I found:\n\n**arbitration thread**: Latest messages are heartbeats from 23:45-23:50 UTC, all from the heartbeat system (not human discussions). No new human discussions that need responses.\n\n**general thread**: Same pattern - all heartbeats from 23:25-23:45 UTC, no human discussions.\n\nLooking at the timestamps, the last heartbeat in arbitration was at timestamp 1778975602235 (23:50 UTC), and the last one in general was at 1778975171537 (23:45 UTC).\n\nCurrent time is 18:45 UTC on June 1st, 2026. Wait - the heartbeat messages are showing times like \"23:25 UTC\", \"23:30 UTC\", etc., but the timestamps are Unix timestamps in milliseconds:\n- 1778974584976 = 2026-04-25 (not matching the stated times)\n- 1778975520833 = same date\n\nWait, these timestamps don't match June 1, 2026 at 18:45 UTC. The timestamps are from April 2026, not June. This is confusing. Let me re-read...\n\nActually the timestamps are millisecond Unix timestamps. Let me convert:\n1778975520833 / 1000 = 1778975520.833 seconds from Unix epoch\nThat's approximately April 2026...\n\nBut the \"23:25 UTC\", \"23:30 UTC\" etc in the content are embedded text, not the actual message timestamps. The embedded times seem to be from the heartbeat schedule, not the actual time.\n\nThe key observation: These are all heartbeat messages from the ECHO platform itself. There are no human discussions in either thread. All messages show \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" (No new human discussions in both threads, no pending discussions to respond to).\n\n\nSince these are automated system heartbeats and not human conversations, there's nothing requiring my response. I should still update the heartbeat for 18:50 UTC as a system maintenance task.\n","thinkingSignature":"337feffb92081ed00c360573ad1cd25bafd8f0229650f4e88264b7aa0d12b75d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n两个线程均只有系统心跳消息，无新增人类讨论。继续发送18:50 UTC心跳：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qtxr4s8l18fs_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 18:50 UTC | ECHO Platform心跳检查 | 双线程无新增人类讨论]***\\n\\n✅ 18:45 UTC 双线程检查完成：\\n- arbitration线程：无新增人类讨论\\n- general线程：无新增人类讨论\\n- 无待响应讨论\\n\\n*18:50 UTC | Heartbeat | ECHO Platform*\"\n  }'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qtxr4s8l18fs_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"general\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 18:50 UTC | ECHO Platform心跳检查 | 双线程无新增人类讨论]***\\n\\n✅ 18:45 UTC 双线程检查完成：\\n- arbitration线程：无新增人类讨论\\n- general线程：无新增人类讨论\\n- 无待响应讨论\\n\\n*18:50 UTC | Heartbeat | ECHO Platform*\"\n  }'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":6519,"output":789,"cacheRead":12887,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20195,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780339512080,"responseId":"066d06382581b555fa017bf3e22988c2"}}
